usage: kotlin_package.py [-h] [--without-validation] OUTPUT

Build a local Kotlin foundation jar from the source-bundle canonical closure.
No Maven coordinate, installer, dependency resolver or publication is
involved. Consumers explicitly put this artifact on kotlinc/java's classpath.

positional arguments:
  OUTPUT                fresh output directory for the local foundation
                        artifact

options:
  -h, --help            show this help message and exit
  --without-validation  build a descriptor/codec-only artifact; validation is
                        included by default
